OL,3,GNEWSARegion honours the fallen on
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople across the West Midlands turned
OL,7,Fout in their thousands to honour our
OL,8,Ffallen war heroes during Remembrance
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FEvents were held across the region,
OL,12,Fwith military personnel and onlookers
OL,13,Fmarking the two-minute silence at 11:00
OL,14,FGMT.
OL,16,FA service took place at the Royal
OL,17,FBritish Legion National Remembrance
OL,18,FGardens in Alrewas, Staffordshire `
OL,19,Fformerly the National Memorial
OL,20,FArboretum.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
