OL,3,GNEWSARegion honours the fallen on
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer British army chaplain, the Rev
OL,7,FClare Callanan, said she was feeling
OL,8,Fnervous ahead of the event because of
OL,9,Fall the work that had gone into
OL,10,Forganising it.
